      "heading": "1 · Generate before you judge",
      "sentence": "An unrelated picture can open a route through a workplace brief. The deadline can stay fixed.",
      "image_brief": "Workshop groups at tables: generate routes before judging — many hands, one room.",
      "quote": "Give each group member a folder containing two or three pictures that are not related to the problem area.",
      "quote_origin": "page_verified",
      "citation": {
        "label": "(Michalko 2010, 440)",
        "href": "/creativity-techniques-uem/lessons/en/creativity-techniques/u-4-1-generate-before-you-judge/#ref-michalko-2010"
