        "dcterms": [
          "dcterms:type=Text"
        ]
      },
      "notes": "- The first lesson protects a generation window inside a real brief.\n- Ask a Crab uses unrelated pictures as prompts; the class adapts its five-step blueprint.\n- The timer is a professor proposal, not a source instruction.\nSource: (Michalko 2010, 440).\nAsk: What can the image open that the first reading of the brief did not?",
      "claims": [
        {
          "text": "Give each group member a folder containing two or three pictures that are not related to the problem area.",
          "cite": "Michalko 2010, 440"
        }
