      "notes": "- Separate recorded actions and words from interpretations.\n- Compare the route notes with U4.1's saved idea set and carry forward one idea that responds to an observed moment.\n- The role rotation, selection criterion, and next-check question are course adaptations. A peer walkthrough is not representative visitor research.\nSource: (Michalko 2010, 371).\nAsk: Whose experience still needs to be checked?",
