      "heading": "Recall check",
      "sentence": "Alone, from memory, 3 minutes. Then compare with a partner.",
      "caption": "Koch triangle course diagram · #5cc4358a",
      "questions": [
        "What kind of stimulus does Ask a Crab use?",
        "Before evaluation, what does the team do with each idea?",
